/* Reuses parts of the :: Sea Tentacles event */
:: Fishing Pier Tentacles
<<effects>>
A <<print ["slimy", "sticky", "thick", "throbbing", "slick", "moist", "quivering", "sodden", "shivering", "shuddering", "narrow", "undulating", "thin", "bulbous", "bumpy"].random()>> tentacle coils around your fishing rod and begins to pull, trying to drag you into the water.
<br><br>

<<if $angel gte 4 and $angelBanish gte 1>>
	<<link [[Banish the tentacles|Fishing Pier Tentacles Banish]]>><<angelBanishUse>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Let go|Fishing Pier Tentacles Let Go]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Hold on|Fishing Pier Tentacles Hold]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty -100 600>>


:: Fishing Pier Tentacles Banish
<<effects>>
You focus your mind on the tentacles coiling around your rod, then make an intricate gesture with your hand. <span class="green">The tentacles shimmer and recoil violently,</span> releasing their grip and retreating into the depths.<<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Tentacles Hold
<<effects>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	You brace and wrench your rod <span class="green">free from the tentacles' grip</span> as they slink back into the depths.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if $daily.fishing.fishingPier.fisher.phase is "fishing" and $rng gte 50>>
		<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
		<span class="red">The tentacles yank hard,</span> but the <<person>> next to you grabs you before you can be pulled in. Your rod slips from your hands and disappears into the sea.<<stress 3>><<gstress>>
		<br><br>

		"You okay?" <<he>> asks, breathing hard.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Say nothing|Fishing Pier Fisher Saved On Pier]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Thank <<him>>|Fishing Pier Fisher Saved On Pier]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Thank with a kiss|Fishing Pier Fisher Thank Kiss]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		The tentacles drag you off the pier and <span class="red">into the water.</span>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Sea Tentacles]]>><<location "seadocks">><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Fishing Pier Tentacles Let Go
<<effects>>
<<handheldruined>>

You let go of your fishing rod as the tentacles pull it into the depths. <<gstress>><<stress 1>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Mer Pier]]>><</link>>
